      <h1 class="ed-title">Buying a Treadmill at Costco</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        Costco can be a good place to buy a treadmill, mainly because of its return reputation and its delivered pricing. It is a poor place to browse, because the selection is small and rotating — and the model on the shelf is often a version you cannot compare directly with anything else.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
